      1						.TITLE UJFP11
      2						.IDENT /00.03/
      3					; CP70 FP11 control and F/D transfer firmware. Absolute HALT FRAM, CP67 module ABI3.
      4					; LDFPS/STFPS/STST support all eight word addressing modes.
      5					; LDF/LDD and STF/STD transfer AC or memory; no arithmetic/conversion yet.
